### filter by orgId.
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30&listLevel=0&orgId=1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org=

### return analysis usage in the list level.
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30&listLevel=1
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org=

### return analysis usage in the organization level
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30&listLevel=0
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org=
